### Sales Analytics API Tests
### Test the new reporting endpoints

### 1. Get Item Performance Analytics
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/items?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get Item Analytics with Date Range
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/items?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Get Revenue Analytics (Monthly)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/revenue?period=monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Get Revenue Analytics (Daily)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/revenue?period=daily&startDate=2024-01-15&endDate=2024-01-21
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Get Staff Performance Analytics
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Get Staff Analytics with Date Range
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/staff?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Get Customer Analytics
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/customers?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Get Customer Analytics with Date Range
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/customers?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. Get Inventory Performance Analytics
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 10. Test Analytics with Different Business (should be empty)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 11. Test Analytics without Authentication (should fail)
GET http://localhost:3031/api/sales/analytics/items
Content-Type: application/json

### 